From b058062a45033427063e88b112af2a5387917592 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Romain Beauxis <romain.beauxis@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 19:01:08 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] avformat/mov: report reserved vpcC colour tags as unspecified

The vpcC colour primaries, transfer characteristics and matrix were only
checked for having a name, and 0 and 3 have one ("reserved").

The swscale frame checks reject reserved values, so scaling such a stream fails
with ENOTSUP. h2645_vui.c reports them as unspecified since c80002aa81
("avcodec/h2645_vui: Ensure color primaries/trc/space isn't reserved value"),
do the same here. Valid values are untouched.

[Hades: backport to 9.1 without tests/ref/fate/mov-vpcc-reserved-color-tags: FATE files of tests that master added after 9.1 (or, for libavformat/tests/.gitignore, a file the release tarball does not have).]

(cherry picked from commit b058062a45033427063e88b112af2a5387917592)
Upstream: https://github.com/FFmpeg/FFmpeg/commit/b058062a45033427063e88b112af2a5387917592
---
 libavformat/mov.c | 12 +++++++++---
 1 file changed, 9 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/libavformat/mov.c b/libavformat/mov.c
index 1ad5b68..e66befa 100644
--- a/libavformat/mov.c
+++ b/libavformat/mov.c
@@ -6922,11 +6922,17 @@ static int mov_read_vpcc(MOVContext *c, AVIOContext *pb, MOVAtom atom)
     if (avio_rb16(pb)) /* codecIntializationDataSize */
         return AVERROR_INVALIDDATA;
 
-    if (!av_color_primaries_name(color_primaries))
+    // Reserved and unassigned values carry no colour information
+    if (color_primaries == AVCOL_PRI_RESERVED0 ||
+        color_primaries == AVCOL_PRI_RESERVED  ||
+        !av_color_primaries_name(color_primaries))
         color_primaries = AVCOL_PRI_UNSPECIFIED;
-    if (!av_color_transfer_name(color_trc))
+    if (color_trc == AVCOL_TRC_RESERVED0 ||
+        color_trc == AVCOL_TRC_RESERVED  ||
+        !av_color_transfer_name(color_trc))
         color_trc = AVCOL_TRC_UNSPECIFIED;
-    if (!av_color_space_name(color_space))
+    if (color_space == AVCOL_SPC_RESERVED ||
+        !av_color_space_name(color_space))
         color_space = AVCOL_SPC_UNSPECIFIED;
 
     st->codecpar->color_range     = (color_range & 1) ? AVCOL_RANGE_JPEG : AVCOL_RANGE_MPEG;
